Solid Gold

A jump'n run with 8-way soft scrolling in the style of the early 90s: ten levels across four worlds, each hiding the artefact that leads to the next.

Year: 2013
Authors: Frank Wille, Gerrit Wille, Pierre Horn (Night Owl Design)
Genre: Platformer
Disks: 1

Freeware; source and data public domain.
